        "answer": {
          "short": "$54\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A_{ADC}&=\\frac{bh}{2}\\\\36&=\\frac{8\\times h}{2}\\\\h&=9\\text{ m}\\\\A_{ABD}&=\\frac{12\\times9}{2}\\\\A_{ABD}&=54\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
